{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1e4667c82d0c000c420d7248ced93367f92dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {5x - 11}{2x^2 + x - 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"97\" height=\"40\" /> was obtained by adding the two fractions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb0f5c568037b7a1e50c01c932f9d395874bd15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {A}{x + 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"44\" height=\"39\" /> and \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866795924256a1686a508bf7b86f4064295c5e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {B}{2x - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />. The values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> must be, respectively: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/bafa60c1cde960b4847759abffaa58b61db13b88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5x,-11\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -11,5x\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -1,3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3,-1\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5,-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"568\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is essentially asking for the partial fraction decomposition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324a4d49a88c01b257239e396b0599a533f6028d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5x-11}{2x^2 + x - 6}\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />\nLooking at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, we can write\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/6/086d190caa252e594851305113d5bd5aa3d9347d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A(2x-3) + B(x+2) = 5x-11\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" />.\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919f449f578b6108276c5ef21038500bdb822eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bbada5205ede167ec67a5bc01a5531bee9a6892.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A(-4-3) + B(0) = -21 \\Rrightarrow A = 3\\]\" width=\"273\" height=\"18\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003bcebc12d2d3dd5107627be5b8f237dff6c147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/440c4986ccc4180c3d2f71702eec4b1de600ff20.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A(0) + B(\\frac{7}{2}) = \\frac{15}{2} - \\frac{22}{2} \\Rrightarrow B = -1\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"37\" />\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <